    "has_finalization": false,
    "is_clean": null,
    "secondary_exceptions_count": 0,
    "primary_exception_kind": null,
    "effects": []
  },
  "notes": "when_not matches when the condition is false; a missing field (None) is not equal to 'fraud', so the rule matches (SPEC 14.2)."
